 <b class=\"terminal-c\">git clone https://github.com/oil-oil/my-first-page.git</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Cloning into 'my-first-page'...</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Enumerating objects: 36, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Counting objects: 100% (36/36), done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Receiving objects: 100% (36/36), 12.4 KiB | 2.1 MiB/s, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">当前目录多了一个 my-first-page 文件夹</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> 修复按钮在手机上错位</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> 完成首页导航栏</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> 首页基础版本</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> 初始化项目</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">clone 完成后可使用 git log 查看提交历史</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex:1\">oil-oil / my-first-page</span>\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px\">⑂ Fork <b>12</b></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:20px\">⑂</span>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">xiaoli / my-first-page</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">forked from oil-oil/my-first-page</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px 12px\">Fork 在你的账号下创建副本；clone 到本地后可将提交推送到该副本</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex:1\">my-first-page</span>\n        <span style=\"background:#1f883d;color:#fff;font-size:12px;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;font-weight:600\">&lt;&gt; Code ▾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.06)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;padding:8px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\"><span style=\"color:var(--text);border-bottom:2px solid #fd8c73;padding-bottom:6px;font-weight:600\">HTTPS</span><span style=\"padding-bottom:6px\">SSH</span><span style=\"padding-bottom:6px\">GitHub CLI</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px\">\n            <span style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis\">https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</span>\n            <span style=\"flex:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px\">📋 Copy URL</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — ~/projects</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git clone https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Cloning into 'my-first-page'...</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Enumerating objects: 36, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Counting objects: 100% (36/36), done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Receiving objects: 100% (36/36), 12.4 KiB | 2.1 MiB/s, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">Created a local repository at ~/projects/my-first-page</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> Fix button alignment on mobile</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> Finish the home-page navigation</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> Home page basic version</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> Initialize project</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">After cloning, use git log to view the commit history</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex:1\">maya-lee / my-first-page</span>\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px\">⑂ Fork <b>12</b></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:20px\">⑂</span>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">xiaoli / my-first-page</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">forked from maya-lee/my-first-page</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px 12px\">A fork is a separate repository under your account. Clone the fork locally before working on it and pushing commits to it.</div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"clone-anat\"><span class=\"ap clone-proto\" data-ap=\"proto\">https://</span><span class=\"ap clone-host\" data-ap=\"host\">github.com</span><span>/</span><span class=\"ap clone-user\" data-ap=\"user\">oil-oil</span><span>/</span><span class=\"ap clone-repo\" data-ap=\"repo\">my-first-page.git</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"clone-anat\"><span class=\"ap clone-proto\" data-ap=\"proto\">https://</span><span class=\"ap clone-host\" data-ap=\"host\">github.com</span><span>/</span><span class=\"ap clone-user\" data-ap=\"user\">maya-lee</span><span>/</span><span class=\"ap clone-repo\" data-ap=\"repo\">my-first-page.git</span></div>","parts":[{"key":"proto","cn":"协议","en":"HTTPS","desc":"可以先复制 HTTPS 地址，不需要另外配置 SSH 密钥","desc_en":"An HTTPS URL works without setting up an SSH key first."},{"key":"host","cn":"平台","en":"Host","desc":"仓库托管在哪个网站，GitHub、Gitee 都长这样","desc_en":"The Git hosting service, such as GitHub or Gitee"},{"key":"user","cn":"账号名","en":"Owner","desc":"仓库是谁的，fork 之后这一段会变成你的名字","desc_en":"The repository owner; after a fork, this segment becomes your account name"},{"key":"repo","cn":"仓库名","en":"Repository","desc":"项目名字，clone 下来的文件夹默认就叫它","desc_en":"The repository name, which also becomes the local folder name by default"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"克隆仓库","en":"git clone","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone https://github.com/oil-oil/my-first-page.git</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</span>","when":"下载工作文件、仓库元数据和可达提交历史","when_en":"Download working files, repository metadata, and reachable commit history"},{"cn":"改文件夹名","en":"clone + 名字","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone &lt;地址&gt; my-app</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone &lt;address&gt; my-app</span>","when":"想换个本地文件夹名","when_en":"Want to change the name of the local folder"},{"cn":"下载 ZIP","en":"Download ZIP","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Code ▾ → Download ZIP</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Code ▾ → Download ZIP</span>","when":"仅需要工作文件且不需要 Git 历史时","when_en":"When you only need working files and no Git history"},{"cn":"派生仓库","en":"Fork","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">网页右上 ⑂ Fork</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Upper right of the webpage ⑂ Fork</span>","when":"需要在自己的账号下建立远程副本时","when_en":"When you need to create a remote copy under your own account"}],"use":[{"t":"第一次参与一个 GitHub 项目时，复制正确的仓库地址再 Clone","m":"clone-url"},{"t":"Clone 完先进入新文件夹，阅读 README 和项目配置","m":"clone-history"},{"t":"确认项目需要的运行环境后，再安装依赖并启动","m":"clone-update"},{"t":"之后同步新增版本使用 Pull，不要重复下载整个项目","m":"clone-fork"}],"dont":[{"t":"把下载 ZIP 当成 clone；压缩包不包含 Git 历史","m":"clone-zip-bad","bad":true},{"t":"在没有写入权限的仓库里直接尝试 Push","m":"clone-fork-bad","bad":true},{"t":"反复 Clone 出“项目-2”“项目-最新”等重复文件夹","m":"clone-dup-bad","bad":true},{"t":"取得项目后没有安装依赖，就直接尝试启动","m":"clone-noinstall-bad","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"新成员第一次拿到 GitHub 项目，既要修改代码，也要保留版本记录。应该怎样开始？","options":[{"id":"clone-read-setup","label":"用正确仓库地址 Clone，进入新目录阅读 README，再按配置安装依赖","feedback":"Clone 会取得代码和历史，随后按项目说明建立环境，后续更新再使用 Pull。","correct":true},{"id":"download-zip-equivalent","label":"下载 ZIP 并解压，把它当作包含完整 Git 历史的仓库","feedback":"压缩包通常只有当前文件快照，没有分支、提交历史和远端关联。","correct":false},{"id":"repeat-clone-updates","label":"每次有更新都再次 Clone，并用文件夹名称区分版本","feedback":"反复下载会制造多个不一致现场，已有仓库应使用 Pull 同步。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A new teammate needs a local copy of a GitHub project, including its code and version history. How should they begin?","options":[{"id":"clone-read-setup","label":"Clone the correct repository, enter the new directory, read README, and install from project configuration","feedback":"Clone retrieves code and history, setup follows project guidance, and later updates use Pull.","correct":true},{"id":"download-zip-equivalent","label":"Download and unzip an archive and treat it as a repository with complete Git history","feedback":"An archive generally contains a file snapshot without branches, commit history, or remote connection.","correct":false},{"id":"repeat-clone-updates","label":"Clone again for every update and distinguish versions through folder names","feedback":"Repeated downloads create inconsistent workspaces; an existing repository should use Pull.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请用给定仓库地址 Clone 到一个明确的新目录，进入后先阅读 README、package 配置和环境示例，再安装依赖并启动。确认 git remote 和当前分支正确；以后同步使用 Pull，不重复 Clone。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Clone the provided repository into one clearly named new directory, then inspect README, package configuration, and environment examples before installing and starting. Verify remote and branch; use Pull for later synchronization."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--clone is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-transfer-visual\">\n      <div class=\"git-repo-card is-cloud\"><span class=\"git-repo-icon\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><b>GitHub 项目</b><small>代码和全部版本记录</small></span></div>\n      <div class=\"git-motion\"><span>第一次完整下载</span><small>clone</small><i>→</i></div>\n      <div class=\"git-folder-card\"><span class=\"git-folder-icon\"></span><span><b>新的项目文件夹</b><small>代码和历史都在电脑里</small></span></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git clone 项目地址</span><p>Clone 是第一次取得一个项目：它会新建文件夹，并把代码与版本历史一起下载。以后获取新增内容使用 Pull，不必重新 Clone。\n</p></div>\n</div>","references":[{"title":"git-clone 官方文档","source":"git-scm","url":"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-clone","title_en":"Git - git-clone Documentation"}],"scenes":["GitHub Code 按钮复制地址","终端 git clone 下载","clone 后查看提交历史","fork 他人的仓库"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"git-story git-story--clone is-detail\">\n  <div class=\"git-story-main\"><div class=\"git-transfer-visual\">\n      <div class=\"git-repo-card is-cloud\"><span class=\"git-repo-icon\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><b>Remote repository</b><small>Files and commit history</small></span></div>\n      <div class=\"git-motion\"><span>Create a local copy</span><small>clone</small><i>→</i></div>\n      <div class=\"git-folder-card\"><span class=\"git-folder-icon\"></span><span><b>New local repository</b><small>Ready to work on your computer</small></span></div>\n    </div></div>\n  <div class=\"git-story-answer\"><span class=\"git-command\">git clone &lt;repository-url&gt;</span><p>Clone creates a new local repository from a remote repository, including its files, branches, and commit history. After cloning once, use pull to bring later remote commits into that local repository.\n</p></div>\n</div>","use":[{"t":"Start work on an existing repository","m":"clone-url"},{"t":"Download a full project history","m":"clone-history"},{"t":"Create a fresh local working copy","m":"clone-update"},{"t":"Set up the default remote automatically","m":"clone-fork"}],"dont":[{"t":"Clone into a directory that already contains important files","m":"clone-zip-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Download code from an untrusted source and run it immediately","m":"clone-fork-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Clone again every time the remote changes","m":"clone-dup-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Assume private dependencies and environment settings are included","m":"clone-noinstall-bad","bad":true}],"scenes":["Join a project","Set up a new computer","Review an open-source repository","Create a clean working copy"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex:1\">my-first-page</span>\n        <span style=\"background:#1f883d;color:#fff;font-size:12px;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 12px;font-weight:600\">&lt;&gt; Code ▾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.06)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;padding:8px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\"><span style=\"color:var(--text);border-bottom:2px solid #fd8c73;padding-bottom:6px;font-weight:600\">HTTPS</span><span style=\"padding-bottom:6px\">SSH</span><span style=\"padding-bottom:6px\">GitHub CLI</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px\">\n            <span style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;padding:5px 8px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis\">https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</span>\n            <span style=\"flex:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px\">📋 Copy URL</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — ~/projects</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git clone https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</b></span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Cloning into 'my-first-page'...</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Enumerating objects: 36, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">remote: Counting objects: 100% (36/36), done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">Receiving objects: 100% (36/36), 12.4 KiB | 2.1 MiB/s, done.</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-g\">Created a local repository at ~/projects/my-first-page</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\" class=\"terminal-win\">\n      <div class=\"terminal-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>zsh — my-first-page</span></div>\n      <div class=\"terminal-body\">\n        <span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> Fix button alignment on mobile</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> Finish the home-page navigation</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">b4c5d67</span> Home page basic version</span>\n        <span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> Initialize project</span>\n        <span class=\"terminal-d\">After cloning, use git log to view the commit history</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;flex:1\">maya-lee / my-first-page</span>\n        <span style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px\">⑂ Fork <b>12</b></span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:20px\">⑂</span>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">xiaoli / my-first-page</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">forked from maya-lee/my-first-page</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 14px 12px\">A fork is a separate repository under your account. Clone the fork locally before working on it and pushing commits to it.</div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone https://github.com/maya-lee/my-first-page.git</span>","when":"Download working files, repository metadata, and reachable commit history"},{"label":"clone + folder name","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git clone &lt;address&gt; my-app</span>","when":"Want to change the name of the local folder"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Code ▾ → Download ZIP</span>","when":"When you only need working files and no Git history"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Upper right of the webpage ⑂ Fork</span>","when":"When you need to create a remote copy under your own account"}]},"usageMocks":{"clone-url":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"clone-code-btn\">&lt;&gt; Code ▾</span><span class=\"clone-url-row\" style=\"padding:6px 0 0\"><span class=\"clone-url\">https://github.com/oil-oil/my-first-page.git</span><span class=\"clone-copy\">📋</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">绿色 Code 按钮，复制 HTTPS 地址</span></div>","clone-history":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git log --oneline</b></span><span><span class=\"terminal-a\">e7b2d48</span> 修复按钮在手机上错位</span><span><span class=\"terminal-a\">a3f9c21</span> 完成首页导航栏</span><span><span class=\"terminal-a\">0f1e2d3</span> 初始化项目</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">clone 默认获取可达的提交历史</span>","clone-update":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">第一次 clone 整仓</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">之后 pull 增量</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">拿更新不用重新 clone</span>","clone-fork":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">⑂ Fork</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">在你的账号下创建仓库副本</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">fork 在托管平台复制，clone 下载到本地</span></div>","clone-zip-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">Download ZIP</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">git log 无法运行</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">ZIP 包含工作文件，但不包含 .git 目录和提交历史</span></div>","clone-fork-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">git push</b></span><span class=\"terminal-r\">remote: Permission to oil-oil/my-first-page.git denied.</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">没有原仓库写入权限时，应 fork 到自己的账号后推送</span>","clone-dup-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">📁 my-first-page<br>📁 my-first-page-2<br>📁 my-first-page-最新</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">clone 三份后，难以确认哪个目录最新</span></div>","clone-noinstall-bad":"<div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\"><span><b class=\"terminal-p\">$</b> <b class=\"terminal-c\">npm run dev</b></span><span class=\"terminal-r\">Error: Cannot find module 'react'</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">clone 后应先执行 npm install，再运行项目</span>"}}}